# Physical Keyboard Preservation

End of automation must not release user pre-held Shift/Ctrl/Alt. Track and restore only Pipela-sent keys.
`pipela_input_hooks` / worker loops: no blind run-end keyboard sync. No `AttachThreadInput` for focus restore.
Hotkey hooks swallow consumed events. See `cpp/src/native/input_hooks/`.
